Katie McLaughlin: `Django Translations for the next generation <https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1yG8Cr1GcVcWUroPcIGHr4eqZblk5qQWIR1j0iGCuY6k/edit#slide=id.g7d7b1e67a3_0_218>`_

